 "body": {
  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "What did reporting depend on before it switched to the event-bus?\n[2025-06-19] standup/boreal/2025-06-19: As before, webhooks needs the event-bus to work. [2025-02-11] standup/boreal/2025-02-11: If the event bus is down, the notification service is down: it relies on it for delivery events. [2025-09-23] standup/dune/2025-09-23: Reporting switches from Ledger to the bus as its source. Why: the nightly ledger scans were blocking billing runs. Reporting no longer depends on Ledger.",
